<https://hexplain.io/ns/fn#isNoData> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "True when value equals the no-data value in effect: the band's own araster:noDataValue, else that of the grid that has the band (araster:hasBand). Compared as xsd:double; a NaN no-data value matches a NaN value, although NaN never equals itself numerically. False when no no-data value is in effect. Deterministic: exactly one answer or none."@en .
